book.red_reign.book.chapter_ii.effects.e:
The Red Queen’s influence has certain effects on the world. They are as follows:
- The white blessing has been removed from the world, the Player's regeneration is ineffective;
- The Queen demands her tribute, all regeneration is reduced by 40%%;
- There is a plague in the world, all meat dropped by animals has a 50%% chance of rotting;
- The Player can draw health from meat, eating meat restores health;
- You can access the Red Queen’s power at a special workbench.
